  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling the drivers of sexual violence against girls in school  (South Africa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work will work with four consortia of organisations to develop and test a range of approaches to tackle some of the key drivers of sexual violence against girls in school.  Activities will include the creation of safer and more effective schools, income strengthening for girls, women and their families, safer homes, safer schools and safer community environments.</narrative>
  </description>
